{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_title", "source_sha256": "a78a40febfa8c80c73188ae68886d10c426bde1049dba232f36cc74318682a8b", "ja": "私の知らない、私", "zh": "我不认识的自己", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_synopsis", "source_sha256": "03a8fb7b5fea14d9936896e09b273314daf5735ac88cb1c09005e64e09234375", "ja": "琴葉の新曲お披露目公演レッスンが始まる。\n直前に見たエレナや恵美の新曲に圧倒され、\n成長しなくちゃと焦る琴葉。自分を卑下する\n気持ちは劣等感ではなく、強い向上心だと\nプロデューサーに指摘され、高みを目指す。", "zh": "琴叶的新曲公开公演排练开始了。\n她被排练前看到的艾莲娜与惠美的新曲所震撼，\n因觉得自己必须成长而倍感焦躁。在制作人指出\n她自轻自贱的心情并非自卑、而是强烈的上进心后，\n琴叶下定决心，向着更高处迈进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1000_p", "source_sha256": "40e7b0289720535b9ef2ef9af86bf006d3f8dd27705acebb467c255ccac04aa0", "ja": "（定期公演のレッスンが始まった。琴葉の希望で、\n最初から全体を通しでやってみたが……）", "zh": "（定期公演的排练开始了。按照琴叶的希望，一开始就完整地排练了一遍，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "ccc35e7f3fcf2fe060a51a71cb8b4e83ab41ab1ca2529d6cebd2b9e877ba62fb", "ja": "志保ちゃん、昴ちゃん、\n気になるところがあったら言ってね。", "zh": "志保、昴，\n要是有在意的地方就告诉我哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "fa63bc6f1172c8f7cc9838d016b15130529b87fa193212b980ee4547b815d170", "ja": "ていうか、初日なのに、みんな振り付け覚えるの\n早くない？　オレ、まだうろ覚えなんだけど……。", "zh": "话说回来，明明是第一天，大家记舞步也太快了吧？我还只是稀里糊涂记得一些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "7b40618b48b196e79ab1b10a017b3e7741834348a5e7bb57f6e18b5f254d9ae7", "ja": "私も不安なので……\n琴葉さん、新曲、もう1回お願いできますか？", "zh": "我也有点不安……\n琴叶，再请你带我们练习1遍新曲，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "47bcfb14e11262452ea059b8a8acf2ae9e3dd1afaf6e6976ed566a43177d481c", "ja": "もちろん！\nじゃあ新曲のところだけ、もう1回やってみようか。", "zh": "当然！\n那就只练习新歌的部分，再来1次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "f924e2c40f4871c00ca3a90f6edde6f529c69fe4f6a762e4ea86056d6cb314d0", "ja": "うん！（はいっ！）", "zh": "嗯！（好——！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1007_p", "source_sha256": "54632053b8ef2b0bbe1f2312a8c4fd254072e3220f6d6b0f17f01c880afeb7dd", "ja": "（相変わらず、みんなの事をよく見ているな。\n普段通りに見えるけど、でも……）", "zh": "（还是一如既往地仔细观察着大家啊。看起来和平时一样，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "3e0d9313b37557ff0113f95bab24c3c43a52afa5dee3260a0c00e82ef9492230", "ja": "うーん……。なんか今日の琴葉、いつもより\n硬い感じがするよね。動きは悪くないんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯……总觉得今天的琴叶，比平时更拘谨一些。动作倒不算差，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "ab9cbcdcfb010a9e84387db9d9ce7e27d2d63dd62afef062803f2e22dd4af3f7", "ja": "そうね……新曲公演というよりは、\nデビュー公演前みたいな緊張感、って感じかしら。", "zh": "是啊……与其说是新歌公演，倒不如说，更像是首次公演前的那种紧张感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1010_p", "source_sha256": "44bf68ec11f907376706d00b34f391d66d063a69fcd6a8daf77e6ccca51c7bf2", "ja": "真と律子にも、そう見えるか？", "zh": "真和律子看起来也是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "8bbcab4e8a255ff7ef65d6decf246a4c327023e1c50c06929adab0eae7dad1b3", "ja": "ええ。新曲のせいかもしれませんけど、\nだいぶプレッシャーを感じてるみたいですね。", "zh": "嗯。也许是因为新歌吧，\n她好像感受到了相当大的压力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "5c15aef1a7cd41c99a3fb6548db8c8d617768ed12079b88de63aca4faa19cc89", "ja": "今のところ、見返せるようにスマホで録画しようか？\nそれなら、あとからでも見返せるし……あっ！？", "zh": "要不现在用手机录下来，之后也能回看？\n这样一来，之后也能回看……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "75fe2169a92d67aefed90697d988655ea237e84dbb2db53e903fa2ff0f47f654", "ja": "どうしたんですか、琴葉さん？", "zh": "怎么了，琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "cd4613e2257b2f301324ca808e02177e0d459ce4bae46bddb532bffd57ecffbe", "ja": "あっ。ご、ごめんね、急に大きい声出しちゃって。\nスマホをどこかに忘れてきちゃったみたいで……。", "zh": "啊。抱、抱歉，我突然这么大声。\n我好像把手机忘在什么地方了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "4ebfc7c8030d0620555bd0bad89677c6f2766f18574f4584f7626a0fcc14ee79", "ja": "ええっ！？　どこかって、どこに！？", "zh": "诶？！你说的“哪里”是指什么地方？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "042e690a47840d303d060b83ed477a79bdb803d01b98d5ba9a9ec1c10dd1a24e", "ja": "大変だ！　みんな、探しに行こう！", "zh": "糟了！大家，快去找找看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1017_p", "source_sha256": "74af692a8b3652b753b26e010941e8c53c308b9d3385d24c26db08ddbcc403e9", "ja": "ちょっと待ってくれ、真。その前に……どこかに\n置き忘れがなかったか、青羽さんに確認してみるよ。", "zh": "真，先等一下。在那之前……我去向青羽小姐确认一下，有没有把什么东西落在某处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "d8fc270f6f76f2e31a509ff0bc781d3b396b4bb255b604d71414060daedf8c2f", "ja": "うう……すみません、{$P$}。\nみんなも。控え室に置きっぱなしだったなんて……。", "zh": "呜呜……对不起，{$P$}。\n还有大家也是。居然把东西一直落在休息室里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "dd3e9b08ebfed925986dd7d797b411b97ecae0b45bafb079f8f9ff15acce2b1d", "ja": "すぐに見つかってよかったわ。けど珍しいわね、\n琴葉がそんなうっかりミスをするなんて。", "zh": "能马上找到就好。不过还真少见，琴叶居然会犯这种粗心的错误。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "e6e5e733455324dff407016e6fb89f9a9a5dbf0c56653ea2b7337f5e532de03d", "ja": "すみません……寝不足で、\nボーッとしてたのかもしれません。", "zh": "对不起……可能是因为睡眠不足，有点迷迷糊糊的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "0ae1914ed29d5b82197a593a0a92b9ca36bb251642263edef5014935744eb39d", "ja": "寝不足なんですか？　だったら今日はもう、\nレッスンは終わりにしたほうがいいと思いますけど。", "zh": "睡眠不足吗？既然这样，我觉得\n今天最好还是别再继续练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1023_p", "source_sha256": "acf497369c54ece06aaff9ae927cb5c1b2df1e194e72bf75ca31aa018add5686", "ja": "そうだな。まだ初日だし、無理は良くない。\n今日のところは、ここで終わりにしよう。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟才是第一天，还是不要勉强自己为好。\n今天就先到这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "8262bab3ffdf6a61a486c16442b351cd8371038dec4b630ea05f918d1d02bba6", "ja": "{$P$}……はい。", "zh": "{$P$}……好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "6cabfda7dee873b30daf742e0ee84eb602b282e4654583c1df828667c493ec85", "ja": "琴葉、ホントにどうしちゃったんだろう。\n大丈夫かな……。", "zh": "琴叶到底怎么了啊。\n没事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "8aec34cf4f5d020b3fb48cde9fa3236210f1eeb5ae4386da9f9ec0246256fcdf", "ja": "そうね……。", "zh": "也是呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1027_p", "source_sha256": "6600c73ef467123ba5867818f1e669cefb6aa2f3fcbb80f8bae5dbbb689904cc", "ja": "（寝不足か……何か悩んでるのかな。\n帰る前に、話を聞いておこうか……）", "zh": "（是睡眠不足吗……是不是有什么烦恼？在回去之前，去听听她怎么说吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1028_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "14c8839ce31f9ee2f75f9e6dc2f50c92037dbb012b342418e6a7cad3fd17a258", "ja": "失礼します……。\n呼び出された理由、なんとなく察しはついてます。", "zh": "打扰了……。\n找我来的原因，我也隐约猜到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "3832a9e65bcd91a83406684cef69b2b0f3539e0e4348e26e0147cb57ddce81dd", "ja": "今日のレッスンのことですよね？\nみんなにも気を遣わせちゃって……。", "zh": "是今天的练习吧？\n还让大家跟着费心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "ab84a70c53947da30793c90b93d52e3465a58da66edca386d1d161737a4c5eb2", "ja": "年下の志保ちゃんや昴ちゃんにまで、心配を\nかけてしまって。こんなんじゃダメですよね……。", "zh": "连比我年纪小的志保和昴都替我\n担心了。我这样可不行呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1032_p", "source_sha256": "7e7db5b82288aa1f5ea709d66f726cc44303f8ca3a00438159213576e023d14d", "ja": "そんなに落ち込む事じゃないと思うけど……そうだな、\nすこし気負いすぎてるようには見えるかな？", "zh": "我觉得没必要这么消沉……不过，确实感觉你有点太逞强了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1033_017kth", "source_sha256": "73068e25f1603110ff054aaddd006175886c10d424ae611e39766bb5b84555df", "ja": "気負いすぎてる、ですか……。", "zh": "太过紧张了吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1034_p", "source_sha256": "caae19f1a58563e487388544b0b1403133cb617238e31c6283bd13138e8f746f", "ja": "うん。律子や真も、心配してたよ。\n「まるで初公演前みたいに緊張してる」って。", "zh": "嗯。律子和真也很担心你。\n她们说：“你紧张得简直就像第一次公演前一样。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "141e61b924eb257558672dab411a4f0a96c88164cb15694de5d6785338090eca", "ja": "初公演前……そうですね。\n気分的には、同じかもしれません。", "zh": "初次公演前……确实呢。\n心情上或许是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "f94d6de5c2bd171e85d98a06f8c6ab73fa808ae14c3b5f9de0b119e97b28329b", "ja": "最初のセンター公演では、やりたいことを探す\nところから始まって……やりきるのに、必死でした。", "zh": "在第一次担任中心的公演时，我从摸索自己想做什么开始……拼尽全力才撑到了最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1037_p", "source_sha256": "3cf59c2edab15d43632b515f933669ae8032fad545d3d80c374f97413ee40615", "ja": "そうだったな。\n……今回の緊張は、恵美とエレナの影響か？", "zh": "是那样啊。\n……这次的紧张，是受惠美和艾丽娜的影响吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "39d5a97c09e593e18ac08d97b5392a57a2c27cfd84c3045f47f3cd07ac772039", "ja": "……。\nそう、ですね。多分……。", "zh": "……\n是啊，大概吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1039_017kth", "source_sha256": "9579ea89267c2644a1c7179dd543d4c299edf6967f5f09fb7b0ca5cf272633ee", "ja": "エレナも恵美も、公演を通してすごく成長してて……\nだから私も、ふたりみたいにならなくちゃ、って。", "zh": "艾丽娜和惠美都通过公演成长了很多……\n所以我也必须变得像她们一样才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1040_p", "source_sha256": "0a6379836d51be854e8816b43d6d5426297e12e1b39a017178279aa29737cd65", "ja": "琴葉……。", "zh": "琴叶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1041_017kth", "source_sha256": "1c42f06bda1f60b8209c700fdaf141bf2f343edf58ba85e02fff3cbc3f8d45e8", "ja": "ひとりになると、いろいろ考えてしまうんです。\n新曲のこと。それを披露する、ステージのこと。", "zh": "一旦独自面对这些，就会不由得想很多。\n比如新歌，还有演唱它的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1042_017kth", "source_sha256": "1b5704621495269a6aca6fbb91b6cf872a01a109c23e9a7fc963b56e61a9c8ef", "ja": "一度考えだすと、止まらなくて……\n夜も、うまく寝付けなくて。", "zh": "一旦开始思考，就停不下来了……\n晚上也总是难以入睡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1043_017kth", "source_sha256": "38e16aa39217c0a9f4d5bc775f7c91c247c9f22539040789f5927689fc8d2259", "ja": "でも、こんなこと、誰にも言えなくて……\nすみません、{$P$}。", "zh": "可是，这种事又没法对任何人说……\n对不起，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1044_p", "source_sha256": "4a34462d57ef71122d9a5acacb3d329466a5361d72ceb3e154798387f7941681", "ja": "謝る事じゃないよ。というか、\nそういう時ほど、遠慮せず話してほしいけどな。", "zh": "没必要道歉。或者说，越是这种时候，越希望你不要客气，跟我说说啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1045_017kth", "source_sha256": "196575190c5dfdf8a3670fe0f55b10c32661dbdf0c8bf8b41f64baab1f7f37dc", "ja": "はい、すみません……。", "zh": "你说得对，真抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1046_017kth", "source_sha256": "ff381952502734ca39659510e77f3c45e21bef07a1b95d00ec1921cc0d45e227", "ja": "ダメですね、私……みんなはどんどん成長してるのに、\n私だけ、ちっとも成長していない気がします。", "zh": "不行呢，我……明明大家都在不断成长，\n却感觉只有我一点都没有成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1047_p", "source_sha256": "fd436a2e5e4e6e2d52e6dc39737538163584dbe30c6a28ee8ef3e3ca5e3f830c", "ja": "そんな事はないんじゃないか。成長しているからこそ、\n自分の足りない部分に気づく事ができるんだと思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得并不是这样。正因为你在成长，才会注意到自己有所不足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1048_017kth", "source_sha256": "cc1e190bd01a5a3d555dbfe6c0d70a705b4385048ddba1f35563e8cf21b606bd", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nでも……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1049_p", "source_sha256": "60193f211a4a174d943f2539aeaa7835c25310486acef2c160cdd540120fad5f", "ja": "（琴葉は納得していない。言葉を重ねたところで、\n今は難しいのかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（琴叶还没有接受。现在就算继续说下去，恐怕也很难吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1050_p", "source_sha256": "40b95a34eeac99b332b726c4f433470c449529fc52508528bb00c15344f12eec", "ja": "とりあえず、今日はもう遅いから帰ろうか。\n駅まで、歩きながら話をしよう。", "zh": "总之，今天已经很晚了，先回去吧。\n我们边走去车站边聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1051_017kth", "source_sha256": "f8d0a93d6c33f14fffe62eb7a42ea44d27f90b4ab14365931587d668dd7bc0ea", "ja": "は、はい。\nすみません、ありがとうございます……。", "zh": "好、好的。\n对不起，谢谢您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1053_017kth", "source_sha256": "d93f344035ce3bd7dc70f27d61483b6bb3e5610547c970a6f93a6ae947156d13", "ja": "なんだか、不思議な感じですね。\n{$P$}と、こうやって歩くって……。", "zh": "总觉得，有种不可思议的感觉呢。\n像这样和{$P$}一起走着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1054_p", "source_sha256": "ec6f3fa1f36b9b64145de4e22437518e9f11e0cc86181825309ac50bfbc71cd1", "ja": "最近は、みんな忙しくなってきたからな。\n……琴葉は、学校はどうだ？　大丈夫か？", "zh": "最近大家都越来越忙了。\n……琴叶，学校那边怎么样？还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1055_017kth", "source_sha256": "a35743654b1c6e9eac5f596ac46f4daa65127e8a9080b7932ba9d84862d10178", "ja": "はい。スケジュールを\n調整してもらっているので、特には。", "zh": "嗯。我已经请人帮忙调整日程，所以没什么问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1056_p", "source_sha256": "286d1254a6c86b0482800a42d4e50144cab32e808cf2f9870e7f16c7411b286d", "ja": "そうか、それなら良かった。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1057_017kth", "source_sha256": "d7b1edfbbb7ad6c07c778f11759bf6d07c8815747ac048d75e93b0a74a77fb62", "ja": "スケジュールひとつとっても、私がアイドルとして\n活動できるのは{$P$}のお陰ですね。", "zh": "就连一份日程安排，我能作为偶像开展活动也是多亏了{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1058_017kth", "source_sha256": "bbf986c1d5e11967bbdbf616728c7a00ede8e6c8321be6a449745aa9c971a41e", "ja": "それなのに、私……。", "zh": "可即便如此，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1059_p", "source_sha256": "4581a5821a898e47a0b778b5fe558f42cbae16ecdfb21da3f8ca3dade58f6102", "ja": "……。琴葉。", "zh": "……。琴叶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1060_017kth", "source_sha256": "12e3695c43db8839268359cd3df8995dd56474d7a45eaec04e64d4413f7e62be", "ja": "は、はい。", "zh": "什、什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1061_p", "source_sha256": "02f6fb58f32fa78b333a5511f2ddcc2f905c809f124c2c7e4e028b9da7bb3983", "ja": "厳しく聞こえるかもしれないけど……今のままで\n公演を迎えても、ファンを喜ばせるのは難しいと思う。", "zh": "虽然听起来可能有些严厉……但照现在这样迎接公演，我觉得很难让粉丝开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1062_017kth", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1063_p", "source_sha256": "c9f29e81c781d8a7a979e79be8c0fa25d4c0cad45e650bf8065b4356962226c4", "ja": "琴葉自身が自分の事を好きな状態でないと、\nいいパフォーマンスはできないだろうし……", "zh": "如果琴叶自己都不喜欢自己，\n恐怕也无法呈现出好的表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1064_p", "source_sha256": "0c6327210489f85653e7e6fb47f3311f150943f5650ba8c79f66ab6fd806869c", "ja": "何より、琴葉を心から好きで、応援している\nファンにとっても、悲しい事なんじゃないかな。", "zh": "最重要的是，对于那些真心喜欢琴叶、一直支持她的粉丝来说，这不也是件令人难过的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1065_017kth", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1066_p", "source_sha256": "6cb4d20638d5d8afe473d3ea0d511254121bbadfb2e959e23f68a0fb8f8f6940", "ja": "自分を卑下しすぎるのは、アイドルとしてマイナスだ。\n自身の価値を、落としてしまいかねないからな。", "zh": "过度贬低自己，对偶像来说是负面的。\n因为这样可能会降低自身的价值。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1067_017kth", "source_sha256": "92ec71e7770136334b633dccd8402ef29458812d301b923a01bc913e2697319f", "ja": "そ、そうですよね。\n応援してくれる人たちがいるのに、私……。", "zh": "是、是啊。明明还有支持我的人，我却……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1068_017kth", "source_sha256": "2128deaa753510dc02c307ed46aa2797d39680e68976130049536be9837f5070", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}。\n私……。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}。\n我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1069_p", "source_sha256": "e782be95269e3ff6e8e46e1a2e1c5e423c41497f02251d808a5af50f599da85f", "ja": "俺に謝る必要はないよ。\n……というか、逆だと思うんだけどな。", "zh": "没必要向我道歉。\n……话说回来，我觉得应该反过来才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1070_017kth", "source_sha256": "e39f9ae8ec947c1791ce8db656ae501c68b6c76ae97d80838e81fa4d59cbbe07", "ja": "逆……？", "zh": "相反……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1071_p", "source_sha256": "a743fa0e9a7aed931954f4ca1a551af18e830ffd9b7c115c0c31bdd8122e69c0", "ja": "うん。琴葉が抱えているその思いは、\n劣等感じゃなく、向上心だと俺は思う。", "zh": "嗯。我觉得琴叶怀抱的这份心情，不是自卑，而是上进心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1072_p", "source_sha256": "70b9aacc57623cfe6088660cc3743032a83c8d533d92a3babad044fe857367bb", "ja": "「誰にも負けたくない」という気持ちが強いから、\n「今の自分じゃダメだ」って思うんじゃないかな？", "zh": "正因为“不想输给任何人”的念头很强烈，\n才会觉得“现在的自己还不行”吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1073_p", "source_sha256": "966700ce61ec1fc52b4c11aedeb01ba26906be6f944f158cd636cb3533465934", "ja": "琴葉は、エレナと恵美の新曲を聴いて……\nふたりの成長を感じて、どう思った？", "zh": "琴叶听到艾蕾娜和惠美的新歌后……感受到两人的成长，心里怎么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1074_017kth", "source_sha256": "8db3b1487a885661197a2bf31e14100f5eb2e7f013ff4b91c06eca001dd41281", "ja": "私は……。", "zh": "我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1075_017kth", "source_sha256": "bde7cd60c63a93f42bd4eca8fe62ba175ad6dfbff615ec0a22d2d2a9ea7a7493", "ja": "私は……正直、「悔しい」って思いました。\nふたりが、私よりずっと上を行っている気がして……。", "zh": "我……老实说，觉得很不甘心。感觉两个人都远远走在我前面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1076_p", "source_sha256": "aba5093a93ff983d5d63c781a0b173359be1315b158aa9d43a0bfeaba8c44c23", "ja": "そうか。……「悔しい」と言えるのは弱さじゃないよ、\n琴葉。ありのままの弱い自分を認められる、強さだ。", "zh": "这样啊。……能说出“懊悔”，并不是软弱哦，琴叶。能够承认原原本本、软弱的自己，是一种坚强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1077_p", "source_sha256": "7e8cc190c1ae5e9f29fd534e3977afd6d90e550508557f9e3e9c2970d69b5d1e", "ja": "琴葉はただ、高みを目指そうとしてるだけだと思う。\n今よりももっと、ずっと高いところを。", "zh": "我觉得琴叶只是想向更高处迈进而已。\n比现在更高、还要高得多的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1078_017kth", "source_sha256": "20a4089ba4b5c134f4c6e91648503d1ad95aefc30a76126c709bca3c91638cee", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nど、どうして、そこまで言い切れるんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n为、为什么您能如此断言呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1079_p", "source_sha256": "1319135ff529cf764e584960fe875bda253050bb976655c57a406fd323ee70c6", "ja": "もちろん、ずっと琴葉を見てきたからな。\n本当は負けず嫌いだってことも、よく知ってるよ。", "zh": "当然是因为我一直都在看着琴叶啊。\n我也很清楚，你其实是个不服输的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1080_017kth", "source_sha256": "4932574400fe88af85028569ad81edc7507494c906fe8044d30f677d7cc2c57d", "ja": "でも……私の、エレナや恵美に\n負けたくないっていう、この気持ちは……。", "zh": "可是……我不想输给艾莲娜和惠美的这份心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1081_p", "source_sha256": "55a26fc3d513a74c2456b6346d14e6d9d347fc686c62065a4b6f343633e6a6be", "ja": "悪い事じゃない。エレナや恵美は大切な仲間だけど、\nそれと同時に、ライバルでもあるんだから。", "zh": "这不是什么坏事。艾莲娜和惠美虽然是重要的伙伴，但同时也是竞争对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1082_017kth", "source_sha256": "349a02251bf8ae67eac266cbad5e4179fee7c13f853d9c911ef5848250f3f5ae", "ja": "ライバル……。でも、恵美みたいに、\n争うことが嫌な子だっていると思います。", "zh": "对手……可是，我觉得也有像惠美那样不喜欢争斗的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1083_017kth", "source_sha256": "34c4748030185f04cbc9180e964d89975e1a04da1980eca5ab95c2d09bbc9fa2", "ja": "私の勝手な感情でみんなを競争に巻き込んでしまって、\nそれでもし、辞めたいなんて子が出てしまったら……。", "zh": "因为我任性的感情，把大家都卷进了竞争之中，\n要是因此让有人产生了想退出的念头……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_1084", "source_sha256": "2c37eba1d43278c6610f89ada2a08c4e8fc9f506c2197306ddb6480ec6700945", "ja": "構わない", "zh": "没关系", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2000_p", "source_sha256": "45920d31f1f1b417e2da1932cb10b5aecac98dd73106a878088cbc99678e52dc", "ja": "構わないよ。\nみんなを巻き込んで、どんどん上を目指してくれ！", "zh": "没关系。\n把大家都卷进来，一起不断向更高的目标迈进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2001_017kth", "source_sha256": "34522e13664799762058f2faea5a2e3991e15e55805bc9440632f7cc1ad760ce", "ja": "え！？　い、いいんですか！？", "zh": "诶！？真、真的可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2002_p", "source_sha256": "9c2f66a359de740af7163056b495d6fa5e939a7ceaf4b3c49d5bb735904f98b5", "ja": "ああ。続けるかどうかを決めるのは本人だし、誰かが\nそう言い出したとしても、それは琴葉のせいじゃない。", "zh": "啊。要不要继续，是由她本人来决定的，就算有人提出那样的要求，也不是琴叶的错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2003_p", "source_sha256": "f6d3e6b07ea67a500e3881cd37f99b2ad1968f51fcc61edf55e6f8970874e0a9", "ja": "もちろん俺は、最後までアイドルと向き合う。\nプロデューサーとして。", "zh": "我当然会作为制作人，\n陪伴偶像认真面对到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2004_p", "source_sha256": "c53cac8cb8308ca5c7e3f7d74a34deeead8cf970e894690bb104dce320148826", "ja": "本当に辞めたいのか、悔しい思いをしただけなのか……\n納得いくまで、とことん話し合うさ。", "zh": "你是真的想放弃，还是只是感到不甘心……\n在你彻底想明白之前，我们会好好谈个够。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2006_017kth", "source_sha256": "4cdde762c791a495fee5405914a51bcd786f7724764fc3abbf1e4ba3d948be41", "ja": "{$P$}は、強いですね。\nそんなふうに、はっきり言えるなんて。", "zh": "{$P$}很坚强呢。\n居然能那样毫不犹豫地说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2007_p", "source_sha256": "ffa9ac861ea1dcdb82d48b51b5f73da646121fba08ba39f7c9f59b3de53a9f24", "ja": "俺が強いんじゃなくて、みんなが強いんだ。\n俺は、それを信じているだけなんだよ。", "zh": "不是我坚强，而是大家都很坚强。\n我只是相信这一点而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2008_017kth", "source_sha256": "daae1494214bd401a72a7e4a372a05c5e6ccc1d03406a5fb4ad0e1c75202e638", "ja": "みんなを……信じて……。", "zh": "我相信……大家……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2009_017kth", "source_sha256": "5e0375eddab1bfb911624dc7d55b078a786b0274b6e4fb818471ba209f582eea", "ja": "{$P$}、私、やってみます。\n私も……みんなのことを、信じます！", "zh": "{$P$}，我会试试看的。\n我也……相信大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2010_017kth", "source_sha256": "ea953affb52ff82aaeae309501c3177762e8ee827b4cd888a2dbb4d9b7d08fff", "ja": "どこまでできるのか、わかりませんけど……恵美にも\nエレナにも、他のみんなにも……負けたくないから！", "zh": "我不知道自己能做到什么程度……但我不想输给惠美、艾莲娜，还有其他所有人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2011_p", "source_sha256": "a70a4bf909f093f7f8af858d90212cc0fbd429d818df2e9a77d5daebdf393f22", "ja": "そうだな、それでいいと思う。\n心配しなくても、責任は取るからな！", "zh": "是啊，我觉得这样就好。\n不用担心，我会负起责任的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2012_017kth", "source_sha256": "01319723c4532a0a840c16a5913e117108de7d7bb219b67ed0da63146fb19adc", "ja": "はい！　……あっ。\nそ、そんな、責任を取るだなんて……！", "zh": "好的！……啊。\n\n怎、怎么能让你负责什么的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2013_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2014_017kth", "source_sha256": "db488d1317e5c970914808c991940cf50596d427ba184471926eb9a883030520", "ja": "い、いえ！　なんだか{$P$}に、\n私より私の考えを知られているみたいだなって……。", "zh": "不、没什么！总觉得自己的想法，\n反倒比我自己还先被{$P$}看穿了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2015_017kth", "source_sha256": "5711ea1bfe24b9735129df3870cd88f1880cbed8f2fc0ca6fd084c53edf00a91", "ja": "そう思ったら、\nなんだか恥ずかしくなってきました……。", "zh": "这么一想，感觉有点害羞起来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2016_p", "source_sha256": "3d7c5db679258af6deb9cc3d1fbd1e7138b423832d8294c8ef037505629c7603", "ja": "そんな事はないと思うけど……でも琴葉の事は、\nこれからも支えていくつもりだから。よろしくな！", "zh": "我觉得没那回事……不过，我今后也会一直支持琴叶的。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2017_017kth", "source_sha256": "be30b28d0325d8ce060238bff6971a5017c41d23a1016f4ee2b2ceb3e3a65b78", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます。\nこちらこそ……よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "是，谢谢您。\n我才是……请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2018_017kth", "source_sha256": "d6f5313a5e060792d7b3fde3a4eb106fa058e452af51102be8136180bd43a62b", "ja": "（……まだ、迷いはある。\n本当に、私の選ぶ道が正しいのかどうか……）", "zh": "（……我心里还是有些迷茫。\n不知道自己选择的道路，究竟是不是正确的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2019_017kth", "source_sha256": "f7a7114334de32d8733ff92d601e6387ec0c58fcc21e3388e0214e84a6e42549", "ja": "（でも、どんなに苦しくても、怖くても……\n私は、私は変わりたい。前に進まなきゃ……！）", "zh": "（但是，无论多么痛苦、多么害怕……\n我想改变自己，我一定要继续向前……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2020_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_095_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_095_2021_017kth", "source_sha256": "6610845527ded6810d50367075d14f1bbf3f857e4e6d739a4737c4fd609eb093", "ja": "あ……恵美、エレナ。いま、時間いい？\n少しだけ、話したいことがあって……。", "zh": "啊……惠美、艾丽娜。现在方便吗？\n我有件事想稍微聊一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
